@startuml
skinparam defaultFontName Liberation Sans
skinparam defaultFontSize 18
skinparam defaultFontColor #123456
skinparam BackgroundColor #f6f8fc
skinparam titleFontSize 26
left header Native measured text and document regions
title **Checkout** //conversation//\nMeasured styled runs
legend __Confirmed__ and --superseded-- messages
right footer Safe in-memory native rendering
participant "**Browser**" as B
participant "//Service//" as S
group **Checkout**
B -> S : Submit **basket //securely//**
activate S
note over S
Check __stock__

  preserve   spaces
end note
S --> B : <b>Accepted</b>
deactivate S
end
@enduml
